<title>USA: StaffMark completes fourth acquisition.</title>
<headline>StaffMark completes fourth acquisition.</headline>
<dateline>FAYETTEVILLE, Ark. 1997-02-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>StaffMark Inc said Monday it completed its acquisition of Advanced  Personnel Service Inc, its fourth such transaction since it became publicly traded in the fall of 1996.</p>
<p>The company said the acquisition will be recorded as an asset purchase and it expects Advanced Personnel to have a positive impact on its 1997 earnings per share.</p>
<p>Terms of the transaction were not disclosed.</p>
<p>Advanced Personnel is a commercial staffing company based in Memphis, Tenn., StaffMark said.</p>
<p>StaffMark provides staffing services for various businesses,professional organizations and government agencies in southeastern and southwestern United States.</p>
</text>
